# 283.25 — Authority Is Recorded, Not Granted

The central governance invariant is:

$$
 oxed{
Mechanism ightarrow Record(Authority)
}
$$

not:

$$
 oxed{
Mechanism ightarrow Grant(Authority)
}
$$

$$
 oxed{
Prepare ightarrow Decide ightarrow Ratify ightarrow Record
}
$$

These acts MUST NOT be collapsed into one operation.
